    narr:narration """The architectural shift toward [Zypherion adoption](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) is framed as a decisive move, anchored by a [performance-based justification](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) that positions the technology as a significant upgrade for columnar query workloads. This transition is not merely a preference but a [formalized commitment](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) with a defined migration schedule. The strategy is consolidated through a [structured summary](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) that aligns the technical selection, the expected performance gains, and the implementation timeline into a singular, cohesive directive. The broader [performance-justified adoption](narr:Narrative_PerformanceJustifiedAdoption) narrative suggests that the strength of the migration plan is directly coupled to the quantitative evidence provided, framing the decision as a rational, competence-driven evolution of the current infrastructure.""" ;
